---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: All Guides
description: "Every board game guide on Game Night Guide: beginners, couples, 2 players, solo play, and head-to-head comparisons."
permalink: /guides/index.html
---

<div class="wrap">
<h1>All guides</h1>

<p class="lede">Every guide lists players, time, age and price, and says plainly when a price has not been verified.</p>

<div class="grid">
{% for post in collections.guides %}
  <article class="card">
    <div class="c-img">{% if post.data.photo %}<a href="{{ post.url }}"><img src="{{ post.data.photo | replace('.jpg', '-thumb.jpg') }}" alt="{{ post.data.imageAlt or post.data.title }}" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy"></a>{% endif %}</div>
    <p class="kicker">{{ post.data.topic }}</p>
    <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p class="dek">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    <div class="foot"><span class="meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }} · Last checked {{ site.lastChecked }}</span></div>
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
